Operation Endpoint Body / response Add a ruleset <code>POST /api/rulesets</code> <code>RuleSet</code> Remove a ruleset <code>DELETE /api/rulesets/:id</code> — List rulesets <code>GET /api/rulesets</code> Map of name → array of <code>RuleConfig</code> <pre><code>// RuleSet
{
  "name": "takeoff",
  "rules": [
    {
      "name":      "ArmRule",
      "event":     "mode",
      "condtype":  0,                      // 0 = local (`for`), 1 = remote (`for all`)
      "condition": "mode == \"GUIDED\"",
      "action":    "set_arm = true"
    }
  ]
}
</code></pre> <p>Each <code>RuleConfig</code> is assembled into <code>rule &lt;name&gt; on &lt;event&gt; for|for all &lt;condition&gt; do &lt;action&gt;</code> — the same shape as an abumon rules file, so rules move between the two unchanged.</p>
